Package: VBMS
Title: Variational Bayesian Algorithm for Multi-Source Heterogeneous
        Models
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Lu",
             family = "Luo", 
             email = "luolu@stu.ynu.edu.cn",
